# Superseded version backups. ADDED 2026-09-28, before the first public push.
# census_ai_f1_2026.v14.bak.csv holds the 87-row v1.4 snapshot taken before the
# 2026-08-01 inclusion rule was fixed and applied retroactively. It is kept locally
# because census/CENSUS_REFRESH_2026-08-01.md cites it as provenance, but it must NOT
# be published: the README documents exactly one data file, and shipping a second,
# undocumented CSV with a different row count (87 vs 105) and a different Tier-1 count
# (70 vs 88) invites a reader to reproduce the wrong numbers. Reproducibility is one of
# the criteria this dataset will be judged on.
*.bak.csv

